[{"title":"煎香 其一","author":"屈大均","text":"东官黄熟种成田，香气多宜玉片煎。\n一缕氤氲凝几席，炉中微出总非烟。","collection":"明末清初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明末清初.csv","pointer":14008,"sha256":"e0987d82e81e86c470b3cfc377b42f602a847f07513d066f74ace71d94e5d613","dynasty":"明末清初"}},{"title":"煎香 其二","author":"屈大均","text":"朱砂瓦片更相宜，煎取香魂宴坐时。\n生结清甜过熟结，兼金购得一枝枝。","collection":"明末清初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明末清初.csv","pointer":14009,"sha256":"e0987d82e81e86c470b3cfc377b42f602a847f07513d066f74ace71d94e5d613","dynasty":"明末清初"}},{"title":"煎香 其三","author":"屈大均","text":"花农何似作香农，香种成林即素封。\n儿女私藏多血结，煎来气夺水芙蓉。","collection":"明末清初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明末清初.csv","pointer":14010,"sha256":"e0987d82e81e86c470b3cfc377b42f602a847f07513d066f74ace71d94e5d613","dynasty":"明末清初"}},{"title":"朱厓","author":"屈大均","text":"千里朱厓大海中，珠官香尉往来通。\n居人绣面为龙子，竞采珊瑚入水宫。","collection":"明末清初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明末清初.csv","pointer":14011,"sha256":"e0987d82e81e86c470b3cfc377b42f602a847f07513d066f74ace71d94e5d613","dynasty":"明末清初"}},{"title":"闻蝉作","author":"屈大均","text":"梧柳阴森隐画船，临风日夕听凉蝉。\n食薇三载容颜好，谁信夷齐不是仙。","collection":"明末清初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明末清初.csv","pointer":14012,"sha256":"e0987d82e81e86c470b3cfc377b42f602a847f07513d066f74ace71d94e5d613","dynasty":"明末清初"}},{"title":"上泷谣","author":"屈大均","text":"上泷下泷舟不同，双船与石相争雄。\n我行亦与篙人似，半在船中半水中。","collection":"明末清初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明末清初.csv","pointer":14013,"sha256":"e0987d82e81e86c470b3cfc377b42f602a847f07513d066f74ace71d94e5d613","dynasty":"明末清初"}},{"title":"吊永福陵 其一","author":"屈大均","text":"一路松林接海天，荒陵不见见寒烟。\n年年寒食无寻处，空向春山拜杜鹃。","collection":"明末清初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明末清初.csv","pointer":14014,"sha256":"e0987d82e81e86c470b3cfc377b42f602a847f07513d066f74ace71d94e5d613","dynasty":"明末清初"}},{"title":"吊永福陵 其二","author":"屈大均","text":"万古遗民此恨长，中华无地作边墙。\n可怜一代君臣骨，不在黄沙即白洋。","collection":"明末清初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明末清初.csv","pointer":14015,"sha256":"e0987d82e81e86c470b3cfc377b42f602a847f07513d066f74ace71d94e5d613","dynasty":"明末清初"}},{"title":"吊永福陵 其三","author":"屈大均","text":"北狩南巡总寂寥，空留抔土是前朝。\n凭君莫种冬青树，恐有人来此射雕。","collection":"明末清初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明末清初.csv","pointer":14016,"sha256":"e0987d82e81e86c470b3cfc377b42f602a847f07513d066f74ace71d94e5d613","dynasty":"明末清初"}},{"title":"夜上飞云顶","author":"屈大均","text":"天鸡未唤沧溟日，海蜃先衔若木霞。\n独上罗浮最高顶，一声长笛月光斜。","collection":"明末清初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明末清初.csv","pointer":14017,"sha256":"e0987d82e81e86c470b3cfc377b42f602a847f07513d066f74ace71d94e5d613","dynasty":"明末清初"}},{"title":"自秧家至黄窑道中所见 其一","author":"屈大均","text":"山女春晴采笋多，林中双踏落花过。\n千岩草长无樵径，猿鸟纷纷下薜萝。","collection":"明末清初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明末清初.csv","pointer":14018,"sha256":"e0987d82e81e86c470b3cfc377b42f602a847f07513d066f74ace71d94e5d613","dynasty":"明末清初"}},{"title":"自秧家至黄窑道中所见 其二","author":"屈大均","text":"银钗高髻帕轻纱，谷口群栽吉贝花。\n夫在东菑望朝馌，唱歌遥下碧峰斜。","collection":"明末清初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明末清初.csv","pointer":14019,"sha256":"e0987d82e81e86c470b3cfc377b42f602a847f07513d066f74ace71d94e5d613","dynasty":"明末清初"}},{"title":"自秧家至黄窑道中所见 其三","author":"屈大均","text":"万树青枫屋一间，桐花白遍路旁山。\n行人歇马眠春草，看尽徭姬大耳环。","collection":"明末清初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明末清初.csv","pointer":14020,"sha256":"e0987d82e81e86c470b3cfc377b42f602a847f07513d066f74ace71d94e5d613","dynasty":"明末清初"}},{"title":"诃林 其一","author":"屈大均","text":"虞园虽是古浮图，诃子成林久已无。\n一片花宫生白草，牛羊争上尉佗都。","collection":"明末清初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明末清初.csv","pointer":14021,"sha256":"e0987d82e81e86c470b3cfc377b42f602a847f07513d066f74ace71d94e5d613","dynasty":"明末清初"}},{"title":"诃林 其二","author":"屈大均","text":"诃子频婆但有名，菩提不解荫三城。\n天南尚有真蛟蜃，玉殿珠堂俨未倾。","collection":"明末清初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明末清初.csv","pointer":14022,"sha256":"e0987d82e81e86c470b3cfc377b42f602a847f07513d066f74ace71d94e5d613","dynasty":"明末清初"}},{"title":"浮田","author":"屈大均","text":"上有浮田下有鱼，浮田片片似空虚。\n撑舟直上浮田去，为采仙人绿玉蔬。","collection":"明末清初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明末清初.csv","pointer":14023,"sha256":"e0987d82e81e86c470b3cfc377b42f602a847f07513d066f74ace71d94e5d613","dynasty":"明末清初"}},{"title":"屈美人辞 其一","author":"屈大均","text":"新选珠娘作美人，潇湘香草满宫春。\n离骚数为君王诵，讽谏心劳似楚臣。","collection":"明末清初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明末清初.csv","pointer":14024,"sha256":"e0987d82e81e86c470b3cfc377b42f602a847f07513d066f74ace71d94e5d613","dynasty":"明末清初"}},{"title":"屈美人辞 其二","author":"屈大均","text":"三闾苗裔在番禺，有女多才似绿珠。\n一入宫中称第一，不曾歌舞上氍毹。","collection":"明末清初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明末清初.csv","pointer":14025,"sha256":"e0987d82e81e86c470b3cfc377b42f602a847f07513d066f74ace71d94e5d613","dynasty":"明末清初"}},{"title":"送客出洞庭","author":"屈大均","text":"九江今作三湖水，青草茫茫接赤沙。\n千里片帆同落叶，随风飞向碧天斜。","collection":"明末清初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明末清初.csv","pointer":14026,"sha256":"e0987d82e81e86c470b3cfc377b42f602a847f07513d066f74ace71d94e5d613","dynasty":"明末清初"}},{"title":"看剑作","author":"屈大均","text":"剑气时时似白云，时来不得更从军。\n青山只为英雄设，老向松霞不事君。","collection":"明末清初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明末清初.csv","pointer":14027,"sha256":"e0987d82e81e86c470b3cfc377b42f602a847f07513d066f74ace71d94e5d613","dynasty":"明末清初"}},{"title":"三月","author":"屈大均","text":"三月潮鱼尽上田，渔人塞箔向江边。\n我家江口知渔事，著得渔书十二篇。","collection":"明末清初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明末清初.csv","pointer":14028,"sha256":"e0987d82e81e86c470b3cfc377b42f602a847f07513d066f74ace71d94e5d613","dynasty":"明末清初"}},{"title":"白雨","author":"屈大均","text":"炎天白雨早禾宜，更为园林熟荔支。\n今岁无多黄雨下，农夫相庆酒杯持。","collection":"明末清初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明末清初.csv","pointer":14029,"sha256":"e0987d82e81e86c470b3cfc377b42f602a847f07513d066f74ace71d94e5d613","dynasty":"明末清初"}},{"title":"昭君曲 其一","author":"屈大均","text":"憔悴朱颜出塞时，殷勤山上采燕支。\n无功正复惭西子，薄命何曾怨画师。","collection":"明末清初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明末清初.csv","pointer":14030,"sha256":"e0987d82e81e86c470b3cfc377b42f602a847f07513d066f74ace71d94e5d613","dynasty":"明末清初"}},{"title":"昭君曲 其二","author":"屈大均","text":"魂魄千秋逐细君，月明南指汉宫云。\n将军不夺阏氏去，未见功名可冠军。","collection":"明末清初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明末清初.csv","pointer":14031,"sha256":"e0987d82e81e86c470b3cfc377b42f602a847f07513d066f74ace71d94e5d613","dynasty":"明末清初"}},{"title":"香溪曲 其一","author":"屈大均","text":"采香秋自香溪入，采药春从药市还。\n四百名峰行未遍，如何高卧白云间。","collection":"明末清初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明末清初.csv","pointer":14032,"sha256":"e0987d82e81e86c470b3cfc377b42f602a847f07513d066f74ace71d94e5d613","dynasty":"明末清初"}},{"title":"香溪曲 其二","author":"屈大均","text":"七十二溪流水香，香随流水出罗阳。\n山中水碓家家有，香末舂成即稻粱。","collection":"明末清初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明末清初.csv","pointer":14033,"sha256":"e0987d82e81e86c470b3cfc377b42f602a847f07513d066f74ace71d94e5d613","dynasty":"明末清初"}},{"title":"香溪曲 其三","author":"屈大均","text":"罗浮自是一香山，香使山人不得閒。\n一棹香溪贩香去，香如尘土满人间。","collection":"明末清初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明末清初.csv","pointer":14034,"sha256":"e0987d82e81e86c470b3cfc377b42f602a847f07513d066f74ace71d94e5d613","dynasty":"明末清初"}},{"title":"马留辞 其一","author":"屈大均","text":"山留铜柱水铜船，新息威灵在瘴天。\n终古马留称汉裔，衣冠长守象林边。","collection":"明末清初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明末清初.csv","pointer":14035,"sha256":"e0987d82e81e86c470b3cfc377b42f602a847f07513d066f74ace71d94e5d613","dynasty":"明末清初"}},{"title":"马留辞 其二","author":"屈大均","text":"朝鸣铜鼓伏波祠，大汉儿孙实在兹。\n一任金标埋没尽，马人终古识华夷。","collection":"明末清初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明末清初.csv","pointer":14036,"sha256":"e0987d82e81e86c470b3cfc377b42f602a847f07513d066f74ace71d94e5d613","dynasty":"明末清初"}},{"title":"寄无可禅师","author":"屈大均","text":"罗浮采药失佳期，闻道嵩阳钖杖移。\n珠海含君千里月，秋光长得慰相思。","collection":"明末清初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明末清初.csv","pointer":14037,"sha256":"e0987d82e81e86c470b3cfc377b42f602a847f07513d066f74ace71d94e5d613","dynasty":"明末清初"}},{"title":"赠画者张丈 其一","author":"屈大均","text":"丹青不觉老成翁，尺素长吹大漠风。\n十万骅骝驱笔下，人间谁似画师雄。","collection":"明末清初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明末清初.csv","pointer":14038,"sha256":"e0987d82e81e86c470b3cfc377b42f602a847f07513d066f74ace71d94e5d613","dynasty":"明末清初"}},{"title":"赠画者张丈 其二","author":"屈大均","text":"曹霸丹青号作家，秋鹰一一起风沙。\n老来鞍马尤神妙，一扫横飞狮子花。","collection":"明末清初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明末清初.csv","pointer":14039,"sha256":"e0987d82e81e86c470b3cfc377b42f602a847f07513d066f74ace71d94e5d613","dynasty":"明末清初"}},{"title":"赠画者张丈 其三","author":"屈大均","text":"万里风沙一紫骝，笔端飞出玉门秋。\n祗应燕颔人骑得，西取天山到海头。","collection":"明末清初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明末清初.csv","pointer":14040,"sha256":"e0987d82e81e86c470b3cfc377b42f602a847f07513d066f74ace71d94e5d613","dynasty":"明末清初"}},{"title":"赠画者张丈 其四","author":"屈大均","text":"黄毛鹞子海东青，尽作愁胡上素屏。\n画手不知秋眼疾，持来惊落白鹇翎。","collection":"明末清初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明末清初.csv","pointer":14041,"sha256":"e0987d82e81e86c470b3cfc377b42f602a847f07513d066f74ace71d94e5d613","dynasty":"明末清初"}},{"title":"赠画者张丈 其五","author":"屈大均","text":"毫端日日出奇毛，飞落云霄未肯高。\n爱向林塘惊翡翠，锦鞲不上武陵豪。","collection":"明末清初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明末清初.csv","pointer":14042,"sha256":"e0987d82e81e86c470b3cfc377b42f602a847f07513d066f74ace71d94e5d613","dynasty":"明末清初"}},{"title":"赠画者张丈 其六","author":"屈大均","text":"自合胭脂染紫骝，无声已作一天秋。\n沙边久立期飞将，榆柳阴阴卸络头。","collection":"明末清初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明末清初.csv","pointer":14043,"sha256":"e0987d82e81e86c470b3cfc377b42f602a847f07513d066f74ace71d94e5d613","dynasty":"明末清初"}},{"title":"题画兰册 其一","author":"屈大均","text":"兰为香祖少人知，花叶多因风露滋。\n沅澧已无芳草地，青青惟向画中垂。","collection":"明末清初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明末清初.csv","pointer":14044,"sha256":"e0987d82e81e86c470b3cfc377b42f602a847f07513d066f74ace71d94e5d613","dynasty":"明末清初"}},{"title":"题画兰册 其二","author":"屈大均","text":"罗浮夜半欲开时，多谢微风不肯吹。\n香隔山来归绢素，祗应骚客梦魂知。","collection":"明末清初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明末清初.csv","pointer":14045,"sha256":"e0987d82e81e86c470b3cfc377b42f602a847f07513d066f74ace71d94e5d613","dynasty":"明末清初"}},{"title":"题画兰册 其三","author":"屈大均","text":"平生作画恨无师，花鸟而今学已迟。\n欲作道人兰弟子，潇烟湘雨写枝枝。","collection":"明末清初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明末清初.csv","pointer":14046,"sha256":"e0987d82e81e86c470b3cfc377b42f602a847f07513d066f74ace71d94e5d613","dynasty":"明末清初"}},{"title":"题画 其一","author":"屈大均","text":"半挂峰端作数折，人言绝胜谷帘泉。\n盘旋欲下不即下，似欲天风吹作烟。","collection":"明末清初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明末清初.csv","pointer":14047,"sha256":"e0987d82e81e86c470b3cfc377b42f602a847f07513d066f74ace71d94e5d613","dynasty":"明末清初"}},{"title":"题画 其二","author":"屈大均","text":"瀑花枫叶两争飞，红白随风入翠微。\n正熟蒲桃猿引子，未残明月客忘归。","collection":"明末清初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明末清初.csv","pointer":14048,"sha256":"e0987d82e81e86c470b3cfc377b42f602a847f07513d066f74ace71d94e5d613","dynasty":"明末清初"}},{"title":"秋夕作","author":"屈大均","text":"云汉低垂拂绮城，夜深笳鼓渐无声。\n愁人不忍闻鸿雁，念是当年娇女名。","collection":"明末清初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明末清初.csv","pointer":14049,"sha256":"e0987d82e81e86c470b3cfc377b42f602a847f07513d066f74ace71d94e5d613","dynasty":"明末清初"}},{"title":"题铁桥翁黄山画册 其一","author":"屈大均","text":"天都峰似仙人掌，一见惊如太华峰。\n掌上石楼无路上，巨灵曾此擘芙蓉。","collection":"明末清初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明末清初.csv","pointer":14050,"sha256":"e0987d82e81e86c470b3cfc377b42f602a847f07513d066f74ace71d94e5d613","dynasty":"明末清初"}},{"title":"题铁桥翁黄山画册 其二","author":"屈大均","text":"扶松直上鳖鱼背，太古苔花滑杀人。\n石笋干霄吹欲折，天风不惜玉嶙峋。","collection":"明末清初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明末清初.csv","pointer":14051,"sha256":"e0987d82e81e86c470b3cfc377b42f602a847f07513d066f74ace71d94e5d613","dynasty":"明末清初"}},{"title":"题铁桥翁黄山画册 其三","author":"屈大均","text":"汝在罗浮紫翠重，不知身亦老人峰。\n仙人自古多为石，黄石生时是赤松。","collection":"明末清初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明末清初.csv","pointer":14052,"sha256":"e0987d82e81e86c470b3cfc377b42f602a847f07513d066f74ace71d94e5d613","dynasty":"明末清初"}},{"title":"题铁桥翁黄山画册 其四","author":"屈大均","text":"天梯千尺井中悬，㠉峡何如一线天。\n分得苍龙一半险，教人匍匐白云边。","collection":"明末清初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明末清初.csv","pointer":14053,"sha256":"e0987d82e81e86c470b3cfc377b42f602a847f07513d066f74ace71d94e5d613","dynasty":"明末清初"}},{"title":"题铁桥翁黄山画册 其五","author":"屈大均","text":"兄弟高居始信峰，相寻不为扰龙松。\n钩梯断绝苔生铁，食尽菖蒲花紫茸。","collection":"明末清初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明末清初.csv","pointer":14054,"sha256":"e0987d82e81e86c470b3cfc377b42f602a847f07513d066f74ace71d94e5d613","dynasty":"明末清初"}},{"title":"题铁桥翁黄山画册 其六","author":"屈大均","text":"白发长留太古身，匡庐五老未为真。\n高高并立云峰上，中有浮丘一丈人。","collection":"明末清初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明末清初.csv","pointer":14055,"sha256":"e0987d82e81e86c470b3cfc377b42f602a847f07513d066f74ace71d94e5d613","dynasty":"明末清初"}},{"title":"题铁桥翁黄山画册 其七","author":"屈大均","text":"参天一半白云封，怪石株株是箨龙。\n东取黄山千万笋，归来分作一峰峰。","collection":"明末清初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明末清初.csv","pointer":14056,"sha256":"e0987d82e81e86c470b3cfc377b42f602a847f07513d066f74ace71d94e5d613","dynasty":"明末清初"}},{"title":"题铁桥翁黄山画册 其八","author":"屈大均","text":"沿花一路水淙淙，谷口人家吠小庞。\n渡涧不须松一臂，云边自有白砂矼。","collection":"明末清初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明末清初.csv","pointer":14057,"sha256":"e0987d82e81e86c470b3cfc377b42f602a847f07513d066f74ace71d94e5d613","dynasty":"明末清初"}},{"title":"题铁桥翁黄山画册 其九","author":"屈大均","text":"风泉九道落龙潭，飞过诸峰泾翠岚。\n梦里不知真瀑布，只疑疏雨洒松杉。","collection":"明末清初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明末清初.csv","pointer":14058,"sha256":"e0987d82e81e86c470b3cfc377b42f602a847f07513d066f74ace71d94e5d613","dynasty":"明末清初"}},{"title":"题铁桥翁黄山画册 其十","author":"屈大均","text":"白云出入此峰门，人作韶阳双阙看。\n何代云根凝作石，穿云直上翠微端。","collection":"明末清初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明末清初.csv","pointer":14059,"sha256":"e0987d82e81e86c470b3cfc377b42f602a847f07513d066f74ace71d94e5d613","dynasty":"明末清初"}},{"title":"题铁桥翁黄山画册 其十一","author":"屈大均","text":"白云为水水为云，万壑千岩忽不分。\n三十六峰凫雁似，天风吹去总纷纷。","collection":"明末清初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明末清初.csv","pointer":14060,"sha256":"e0987d82e81e86c470b3cfc377b42f602a847f07513d066f74ace71d94e5d613","dynasty":"明末清初"}},{"title":"题铁桥翁黄山画册 其十二","author":"屈大均","text":"从来狡狯是仙真，蝉蜕犹能作石人。\n相对峰边疑绮皓，摩娑亦有老龙鳞。","collection":"明末清初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明末清初.csv","pointer":14061,"sha256":"e0987d82e81e86c470b3cfc377b42f602a847f07513d066f74ace71d94e5d613","dynasty":"明末清初"}},{"title":"题铁桥翁黄山画册 其十三","author":"屈大均","text":"松作蒲团亦可眠，松毛短短软于绵。\n一株倒挂悬崖上，望似苍苍一朵烟。","collection":"明末清初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明末清初.csv","pointer":14062,"sha256":"e0987d82e81e86c470b3cfc377b42f602a847f07513d066f74ace71d94e5d613","dynasty":"明末清初"}},{"title":"题铁桥翁黄山画册 其十四","author":"屈大均","text":"砂笋硫华气易通，温泉迸出冷泉中。\n丹光一片含真火，万树梅花染尽红。","collection":"明末清初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明末清初.csv","pointer":14063,"sha256":"e0987d82e81e86c470b3cfc377b42f602a847f07513d066f74ace71d94e5d613","dynasty":"明末清初"}},{"title":"题铁桥翁黄山画册 其十五","author":"屈大均","text":"黄发青筇逸兴饶，攀跻不觉上云霄。\n天教汝自罗浮至，添得黄山一铁桥。","collection":"明末清初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明末清初.csv","pointer":14064,"sha256":"e0987d82e81e86c470b3cfc377b42f602a847f07513d066f74ace71d94e5d613","dynasty":"明末清初"}},{"title":"瓶花辞","author":"屈大均","text":"兰菊芙蓉及野梅，桂花同带早霜开。\n折归分向铜瓶插，几种幽香入梦来。","collection":"明末清初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明末清初.csv","pointer":14065,"sha256":"e0987d82e81e86c470b3cfc377b42f602a847f07513d066f74ace71d94e5d613","dynasty":"明末清初"}},{"title":"秋日对花作 其一","author":"屈大均","text":"重阳节过即芳菲，么凤枝头啄不稀。\n梅蕊竟先黄菊放，却嫌绿萼得霜肥。","collection":"明末清初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明末清初.csv","pointer":14066,"sha256":"e0987d82e81e86c470b3cfc377b42f602a847f07513d066f74ace71d94e5d613","dynasty":"明末清初"}},{"title":"秋日对花作 其二","author":"屈大均","text":"最是稏兰发箭长，一茎二十四花香。\n争高穿出青青叶，贵种天教产五羊。","collection":"明末清初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明末清初.csv","pointer":14067,"sha256":"e0987d82e81e86c470b3cfc377b42f602a847f07513d066f74ace71d94e5d613","dynasty":"明末清初"}},{"title":"秋日对花作 其三","author":"屈大均","text":"花历天南最不同，吹嘘不必定春风。\n东君自解行秋令，先遣梅开九月中。","collection":"明末清初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明末清初.csv","pointer":14068,"sha256":"e0987d82e81e86c470b3cfc377b42f602a847f07513d066f74ace71d94e5d613","dynasty":"明末清初"}},{"title":"秋日对花作 其四","author":"屈大均","text":"九月初残渐有霜，盆梅移近读书床。\n花开夜半频惊起，一朵浑如万朵香。","collection":"明末清初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明末清初.csv","pointer":14069,"sha256":"e0987d82e81e86c470b3cfc377b42f602a847f07513d066f74ace71d94e5d613","dynasty":"明末清初"}},{"title":"冬日对花作 其一","author":"屈大均","text":"六种争开向药栏，冬来花事不曾残。\n天南春色无来去，长与东皇共岁寒。","collection":"明末清初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明末清初.csv","pointer":14070,"sha256":"e0987d82e81e86c470b3cfc377b42f602a847f07513d066f74ace71d94e5d613","dynasty":"明末清初"}},{"title":"冬日对花作 其二","author":"屈大均","text":"岁寒犹见众花新，幸作长春国里人。\n飞雪丹成先赠妇，流霞酒熟早娱亲。","collection":"明末清初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明末清初.csv","pointer":14071,"sha256":"e0987d82e81e86c470b3cfc377b42f602a847f07513d066f74ace71d94e5d613","dynasty":"明末清初"}},{"title":"兰","author":"屈大均","text":"兰叶青青兰叶长，美人从古在潇湘。\n花多只为三闾发，采入离骚万古香。","collection":"明末清初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明末清初.csv","pointer":14072,"sha256":"e0987d82e81e86c470b3cfc377b42f602a847f07513d066f74ace71d94e5d613","dynasty":"明末清初"}},{"title":"木芙蓉 其一","author":"屈大均","text":"芙蓉面面笑窥池，在木还如在水时。\n终岁芙蓉开不尽，木莲枝接水莲枝。","collection":"明末清初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明末清初.csv","pointer":14073,"sha256":"e0987d82e81e86c470b3cfc377b42f602a847f07513d066f74ace71d94e5d613","dynasty":"明末清初"}},{"title":"木芙蓉 其二","author":"屈大均","text":"枝枝向水影新妆，开向秋深不拒霜。\n萱草不曾销客恨，芙蓉偏解断人肠。","collection":"明末清初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明末清初.csv","pointer":14074,"sha256":"e0987d82e81e86c470b3cfc377b42f602a847f07513d066f74ace71d94e5d613","dynasty":"明末清初"}},{"title":"芍药","author":"屈大均","text":"千枝万朵怨春红，白缬黄楼髻子中。\n折向尊前君不饮，参差笑杀浣花翁。","collection":"明末清初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明末清初.csv","pointer":14075,"sha256":"e0987d82e81e86c470b3cfc377b42f602a847f07513d066f74ace71d94e5d613","dynasty":"明末清初"}},{"title":"虞美人草","author":"屈大均","text":"舞态依依傍药栏，多情春雨未沾残。\n朱颜不与英雄尽，秀作名花万古看。","collection":"明末清初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明末清初.csv","pointer":14076,"sha256":"e0987d82e81e86c470b3cfc377b42f602a847f07513d066f74ace71d94e5d613","dynasty":"明末清初"}},{"title":"老来红","author":"屈大均","text":"秋来花亦解还童，枫叶凝丹与尔同。\n衰白不愁青镜笑，玉颜吾定老来红。","collection":"明末清初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明末清初.csv","pointer":14077,"sha256":"e0987d82e81e86c470b3cfc377b42f602a847f07513d066f74ace71d94e5d613","dynasty":"明末清初"}},{"title":"口占答平山饷荔枝","author":"屈大均","text":"夏至先红惟黑叶，连朝颇恨玉盘空。\n因君饱食思甘蜜，珠玉为心报不穷。","collection":"明末清初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明末清初.csv","pointer":14078,"sha256":"e0987d82e81e86c470b3cfc377b42f602a847f07513d066f74ace71d94e5d613","dynasty":"明末清初"}},{"title":"苔","author":"屈大均","text":"上有梅花下有苔，苔花亦似落残梅。\n行人不识苔花好，只道梅花不是莓。","collection":"明末清初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明末清初.csv","pointer":14079,"sha256":"e0987d82e81e86c470b3cfc377b42f602a847f07513d066f74ace71d94e5d613","dynasty":"明末清初"}},{"title":"庭中珍鸟口号 其一","author":"屈大均","text":"花里青鸡与锦鸡，青鸾亦共白鹇栖。\n青鸡顶上丹砂好，来自朱明洞以西。","collection":"明末清初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明末清初.csv","pointer":14080,"sha256":"e0987d82e81e86c470b3cfc377b42f602a847f07513d066f74ace71d94e5d613","dynasty":"明末清初"}},{"title":"庭中珍鸟口号 其二","author":"屈大均","text":"仙禽亦有白鹦鹉，顶上一花莲倒垂。\n么凤可怜毛太绿，画眉亦自白双眉。","collection":"明末清初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明末清初.csv","pointer":14081,"sha256":"e0987d82e81e86c470b3cfc377b42f602a847f07513d066f74ace71d94e5d613","dynasty":"明末清初"}},{"title":"庭中珍鸟口号 其三","author":"屈大均","text":"琼州倒挂最知风，鹦鹉西洋色更红。\n银了不如金了好，不须剪舌语音通。","collection":"明末清初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明末清初.csv","pointer":14082,"sha256":"e0987d82e81e86c470b3cfc377b42f602a847f07513d066f74ace71d94e5d613","dynasty":"明末清初"}}]